{
  "version": 2,
  "product_command": "cmd/oberth",
  "production_commands": [
    "cmd/oberth",
    "cmd/oberth-source-plugin",
    "cmd/oberth-release",
    "cmd/oberth-store-backup"
  ],
  "paths": "module-relative; p/** includes p and descendants; exact p matches only p; @Cn expands components[Cn]; @components and @components:except:Cn expand owners; @shared expands shared. Deny wins; package_allow overrides component allow. Shared package edges use shared_dependencies. Cross-package local edges (including same-owner edges) require allow membership, except executable-to-own-package edges explicitly listed. Tests may additionally use test package metadata/test_allow and fixture_only; production may not import test-support packages. C12/C14 server imports are empty. The effective intended production permission graph must be acyclic; leaf package_allow entries prevent imports of their consumers. Harness trees test/** and hack/** are not components: within-tree subpackage imports are allowed, product imports require explicit test_allow or fixture_only grants, and product-to-harness imports are denied. Test support is inferred directly below an owned parent from test_support names/suffix; it inherits that parent and its test permissions, with imports restricted to eligible tests or other support. Symbol restrictions apply only to non-test files. shared lists the pinned contract packages; packages.kind distinguishes pure shared values from runtime contract adapters. Component requirements wait while only pinned contract packages are present.",
